<title>USA: Cutter &amp; Buck names two top executives.</title>
<headline>Cutter &amp; Buck names two top executives.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cutter &amp; Buck Inc said Tuesday it has named President and Chief Executive Harvey Jones to the post of chairman and chief executive, while Chief Operating Officer Martin Marks has been named president.</p>
<p>Jones, a co-founder of Cutter &amp; Buck, has been president and chief executive since 1990. Marks joined the company in January 1991.</p>
<p>Cutter &amp; Bucks designs, sources and markets men's sportswear and outerwear.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
